+| [`test_modular_car_assets.gd --vehicle=super_rally --all-kits`](evidence/challenger-panel-corrections-2026-11-14/modules-command.json) | 1,438 / 0. |
+| [`test_super_rally.gd --prepared`](evidence/challenger-panel-corrections-2026-11-14/physics-command.json), [driving](evidence/challenger-panel-corrections-2026-11-14/driving-command.json), [wash](evidence/challenger-panel-corrections-2026-11-14/wash-command.json) | 3,677 / 0; 72 / 0; 1,655 / 0. Exact replay/contacts and 198 km/h remain. |
+| [Six-car coarse-source verification](evidence/challenger-panel-corrections-2026-11-14/coarse-verification-command.json) | 3,223 / 0; retained encoded attributes, exact culling bounds, no extra visible surfaces, fixed/editable agreement. |
+| [Production parser](evidence/challenger-panel-corrections-2026-11-14/parser-final-command.json) | 569 scripts / 0 failures. |
+| [Prepared preflight](evidence/challenger-panel-corrections-2026-11-14/prepared-live-final-command.json) | 551 resources, 2,267 checks / 0 failures. |
+| [Catalogue preflight](evidence/challenger-panel-corrections-2026-11-14/prepared-refresh/picture-preflight-final.log), [workshop refresh](evidence/challenger-panel-corrections-2026-11-14/workshop-refresh-command.json), [image imports](evidence/challenger-panel-corrections-2026-11-14/image-import-receipt.json) | Six exact pictures / 169 current sources; workshop 27 current sources; 58 image MD5s current, no editor errors or project-settings change. |
+| [Compatibility opacity](evidence/challenger-panel-corrections-2026-11-14/opaque-gl_compatibility-command.json), [Vulkan opacity](evidence/challenger-panel-corrections-2026-11-14/opaque-mobile-command.json) | 30 / 0 in each; opaque windows, hidden bright cabin probe, both allocations and exact contacts. |
+| [Compatibility App](evidence/challenger-panel-corrections-2026-11-14/app-gl_compatibility-command.json), [Vulkan App](evidence/challenger-panel-corrections-2026-11-14/app-mobile-command.json) | 13 / 0 in each; actual Garage selection, preview and local race. |
+
+The bonnet support check exposed two valid narrow CDT triangles (one has projected double-area approximately 0.0000072 square metres) that the engine ray helper rejects. Direct clockwise-triangle barycentric evaluation verifies those rendered faces. The original support and 0.5?4 mm clearance requirements remain; no geometry or tolerance was changed to hide the misses. Two attempted private cowl-offset bakes rejected before publication; the baker is byte-exact to the qualified publication input. [Probe](evidence/challenger-panel-corrections-2026-11-14/hood-ray-diagnostic.log) and [final controls](evidence/challenger-panel-corrections-2026-11-14/final-controls.json) retain the evidence.
+
+The broad refresh fence detected concurrent Garage UI edits. [Compiled dependency routes and reconciliation](evidence/challenger-panel-corrections-2026-11-14/prepared-refresh/reconciliation.json) show no model consumers for all six changed UI paths, with every consumed model input and model key exact. Strict prepared and catalogue preflights pass without metadata restamping or dependency-rule edits. [Later UI changes](evidence/challenger-panel-corrections-2026-11-14/late-ui-fence.json) to the same excluded routes are retained separately; whole-UI snapshot stability is not claimed. A preview rejected during a concurrent news-menu edit was rerendered successfully against stable inputs.
+
+The source-only [checkpoint](evidence/challenger-panel-corrections-2026-11-14/source-checkpoint.json) applies and reverses byte-exactly with whitespace checks, using an isolated scratch repository and leaving the shared index untouched. [Publication controls](evidence/challenger-panel-corrections-2026-11-14/native-publication.json) and [final controls](evidence/challenger-panel-corrections-2026-11-14/final-controls.json) preserve all eight car configurations, the runtime SuperRallyModel source and the accepted native bytes. Concurrent UI, world and other vehicle work is preserved.
+
+Only final comparisons and concise receipts remain in permanent evidence. Rejected draft output and duplicate views are under disposable `build/`; the active-work pin is removed and the prescribed retention cleanup is run. [Cleanup](evidence/challenger-panel-corrections-2026-11-14/retention.json) leaves 25.492 GiB against the 20 GiB target: no entries are eligible outside the recent/protected policy. [The retained-output review](evidence/challenger-panel-corrections-2026-11-14/retained-output-review.json) records the largest entries; no protection or grace override was applied. Original roof, arch and upper-fender facets can still show in extreme close specular views outside the marked regions; an AAA finish is not claimed.
+
+No physical-device test, APK/export, backend request, deployment, owner-save change or owner-process action was performed. Restarting/reloading the game, owner appearance acceptance in the four marked views and device loading/performance checks remain necessary.
